  "details": "Currently in the Event card in the Calendar, the title is styled so all words break on the end of the line. It should be changed in the CSS from \"word-break: break-all;\" to \"word-break: break-word;\" so a word only breaks if it's longer than the width of the line, keeping it secure if someone enters e.g. \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\", but not breaking regular words like in the screenshot.",
